\[Upsilon]\[Mu]\[CurlyEpsilon] \[Sigma]\[Tau]\[Eta] \[CapitalSigma].\
\[CapitalDelta].\[CapitalEpsilon].:\\n\!\(StandardForm\`\*FractionBox[\(\
\[PartialD]\), \(\[PartialD]t\)]\(StandardForm\`\*OverscriptBox[\(u\), \(^\)]\
\) \((\[Omega], \\\ t)\) = \
-\)\!\(StandardForm\`\*SuperscriptBox[\(\[Omega]\), \(2\)] \
\*OverscriptBox[\(u\), \(^\)]\)(\[Omega],t) \[Tau]\[Eta]\[FinalSigma] \
\[Omicron]\[Pi]\[Omicron]\:03af\[Alpha]\[FinalSigma] \[Eta] \[Lambda]\:03cd\
\[Sigma]\[Eta] \[CurlyEpsilon]\:03af\[Nu]\[Alpha]\[Iota]: \
