A(\[Omega])\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(\[ExponentialE]\), \(\(-\*SuperscriptBox[\(\
\[Omega]\), \(2\)]\) t\)]\) \\n\>\"", "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
